### Chave lida de api/.env via symlink requests/.env -> ../../../.env
### (não commitar valor real em nenhum lugar deste arquivo).
@baseUrl = https://places.googleapis.com/v1

### Text Search — mesmo field mask usado em providers/google-places-provider.ts
### Bounds de exemplo: Poconé-MT (retornado por google-geocoding.http)
POST {{baseUrl}}/places:searchText
Content-Type: application/json
X-Goog-Api-Key: {{$dotenv GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY}}
X-Goog-FieldMask: places.id,places.displayName,places.formattedAddress,places.location,places.nationalPhoneNumber,places.internationalPhoneNumber,places.websiteUri,places.rating,places.regularOpeningHours,places.businessStatus,places.types

{
  "textQuery": "reciclagem",
  "locationRestriction": {
    "rectangle": {
      "low": { "latitude": -16.2806331, "longitude": -57.0341514 },
      "high": { "latitude": -15.9375775, "longitude": -56.6141789 }
    }
  },
  "languageCode": "pt-BR",
  "regionCode": "BR",
  "pageSize": 20
}
